><highlight color="#9643FC" opacity="0.399994" creationdate="D:20251008131356+10'00'" flags="print" IT="HighlightNote" date="D:20251008131358+10'00'" name="4c3473fb-6386-4957-9b61-5d04b4a3ffbe" page="6" coords="36.000000,493.844269,298.942780,493.844269,36.000000,482.814331,298.942780,482.814331,36.000015,482.846161,298.947601,482.846161,36.000015,471.816223,298.947601,471.816223,36.000015,471.848053,298.997803,471.848053,36.000015,460.818115,298.997803,460.818115,36.000015,460.849945,298.925232,460.849945,36.000015,449.820007,298.925232,449.820007,36.000015,449.851837,298.978790,449.851837,36.000015,438.821899,298.978790,438.821899,36.000015,438.853729,298.924500,438.853729,36.000015,427.823792,298.924500,427.823792,36.000015,427.855621,299.018860,427.855621,36.000015,416.825684,299.018860,416.825684,36.000015,416.857513,298.936096,416.857513,36.000015,405.827576,298.936096,405.827576,36.000015,405.859406,298.941528,405.859406,36.000015,394.829468,298.941528,394.829468" rect="35.655304,394.484772,299.363556,494.188965" subject="Comment on Text" title="alexd"
><contents-richtext
><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:25.1.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2"
><p dir="ltr"
><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:-14.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal"
>Q14c: </span
><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:-13.3pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal"
>Due to these previously unreported findings of low levels of&#xD;psychological stress being associated with poor sleep in elite&#xD;athletes, management of psychological stress particularly in the&#xD;months prior to an Olympic Games, may be important to protect&#xD;sleep in elite athletes. Practitioners should be aware that psychological&#xD;stress may be associated with sleep disturbance and daytime&#xD;dysfunction and monitoring of both psychological stress and sleep&#xD;in elite athletes is warranted. Practitioners should explore cognitive&#xD;and behavioral strategies in athletes to positively influence sleep.</span
></p
></body
></contents-richtext
